    "section_title": "Section 2. Working Hours & Attendance",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "content": "Standard working hours are 40 hours per week, scheduled Monday through Friday from 9:00 AM to\n5:00 PM local time. All employees are required to maintain a minimum of 75% on-site office attendance\ncalculated on a rolling monthly basis. If attendance falls below 75%, an automated warning is issued,\nrequiring immediate review with the HR Department.",
