    "page_number": 1,
    "section_title": "Section 3. Remote Work Authorization",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "content": "Eligible employees may request a maximum of 1 day per week of remote work. All remote work\nrequests require written approval from the respective Department Manager at least 5 business days in\nadvance. Remote work is subject to maintaining positive performance reviews.",
