    "section_title": "Section 4. Leave Entitlement & Notice Period",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "content": "Full-time employees receive 20 days of annual paid leave per calendar year. Leave requests exceeding\n3 consecutive business days must be submitted with at least 14 days advance notice. Unused annual\nleave cannot exceed 5 carryover days into the subsequent calendar year.",
