    "section_title": "Section 2: Incident Response Workflow (Process X)",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "content": "Process X defines the mission-critical incident triage and server provisioning pipeline for high-availability systems.\nStep 1: Level 1 triage must be acknowledged within 15 minutes of automated alert triggering.\nStep 2: If the incident severity is classified as High (Sev-1 or Sev-2), escalation to the Level 2 Engineering Team must occur within 1 hour.\nStep 3: Process X requires full audit trace logging and compliance with Regulation SR-402 Section 5 incident notification window (2 hours maximum).",
